# reticulum-pkcs11-identity

PKCS#11-backed identity support for [Reticulum](https://reticulum.network/).

This package adds optional hardware-token identity support to Reticulum without
modifying Reticulum itself and without requiring any upstream merge.  It follows
Reticulum's principles: minimalism, decentralisation, explicit behaviour, and
self-sovereign identity.

> **Status — alpha / community preview**
> The monkey-patch approach used here is a *temporary workaround* until the
> Reticulum community decides whether to adopt a pluggable identity backend
> upstream.  The patch is small, isolated, and easy to remove.

